{"questions":[{"question":"Kva er $\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x - 3}$ forkorta (for $x \\neq 3$)?","options":["$x + 3$","$x - 3$","$x^2 - 3$","$x + 9$"],"explanation":"Teljaren blir faktorisert: $\\frac{(x-3)(x+3)}{x-3} = x + 3$."},{"question":"Kva er $\\frac{2}{x} + \\frac{3}{x}$?","options":["$\\frac{5}{x}$","$\\frac{5}{2x}$","$\\frac{6}{x}$","$\\frac{5}{x^2}$"],"explanation":"Same nemnar, så vi legg teljarane saman: $\\frac{2+3}{x} = \\frac{5}{x}$."},{"question":"Kva er $\\frac{x}{2} \\cdot \\frac{4}{x}$ (for $x \\neq 0$)?","options":["$2$","$\\frac{4}{2}$","$\\frac{x^2}{8}$","$\\frac{1}{2}$"],"explanation":"$\\frac{x \\cdot 4}{2 \\cdot x} = \\frac{4x}{2x} = 2$."},{"question":"For kva $x$-verdi er $\\frac{1}{x - 5}$ ikkje definert?","options":["$x = 5$","$x = 0$","$x = -5$","$x = 1$"],"explanation":"Eit brøkuttrykk er udefinert når nemnaren er $0$, altså $x - 5 = 0 \\Rightarrow x = 5$."},{"question":"Kva er $\\frac{x^2}{x}$ forkorta (for $x \\neq 0$)?","options":["$x$","$x^2$","$1$","$\\frac{1}{x}$"],"explanation":"Vi forkortar éin $x$: $\\frac{x \\cdot x}{x} = x$."}],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"4bf04dbc362cbf0b","translatedAt":"2026-06-21T22:18:41.498Z","model":"claude-code-agent","strings":28,"tm":{"ab28aeb79abf34c8":"Kva er $\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x - 3}$ forkorta (for $x \\neq 3$)?","c3d62e3337ca6623":"$x + 3$","ed8ee075f954d532":"$x - 3$","4df6d22b10215083":"$x^2 - 3$","1af3f63a8f8617d9":"$x + 9$","7b0df0cf3de93059":"Teljaren blir faktorisert: $\\frac{(x-3)(x+3)}{x-3} = x + 3$.","b589b55e3291653d":"Kva er $\\frac{2}{x} + \\frac{3}{x}$?","47daa6b358cceeb1":"$\\frac{5}{x}$","3fce3f4cd426af25":"$\\frac{5}{2x}$","e0c7d6f30e2137a4":"$\\frac{6}{x}$","f1c67c0b88417aa2":"$\\frac{5}{x^2}$","2ebe5febc965dae1":"Same nemnar, så vi legg teljarane saman: $\\frac{2+3}{x} = \\frac{5}{x}$.","41b6061c07925683":"Kva er $\\frac{x}{2} \\cdot \\frac{4}{x}$ (for $x \\neq 0$)?","5e190bbabd4b027f":"$\\frac{4}{2}$","b03144cb111c1a63":"$\\frac{x^2}{8}$","b61def0872c567fe":"$\\frac{1}{2}$","f0015b40a559c0a3"